Z||000004||West Coast Fiero||12-10-2001||11:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by thecage:<BR><B>thanks for the reply. Now if the cables were adjusted (they say they did nothing but roadtest the car)could this cause the rattle noise i'm hearing when i let up on the gas.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>its possible, but from where I am it could be anything from CV axles going out to a bad bearing in the transmission<P>------------------<BR>Technician, West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
